'''Target Square: On Load Commands''' adds a new [[Lua event]] that triggers when a specific square is loaded. It uses the [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/globalObjects/SGlobalObjects.html SGlobalObjects] systems to register [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/globalObjects/GlobalObject.html GlobalObject]s at specific coordinates that will then later be loaded in with chunks and trigger functions provided by modders. This can notably be used to place an item, a new tile, any kind of object, or simply interact with the world only when that specific coordinate get loaded in.
{{Clear}}
